Gen 32:1 , Jacob's vision at Mahanaim;
Gen 32:3 , His message to Esau;
Gen 32:6 , He is afraid of Esau's coming;
Gen 32:9 , He prays for deliverance;
Gen 32:13 , He sends a present to Esau, and passes the brook Jabbok;
Gen 32:24 , He wrestles with an angel at Peniel, where he is called Israel;
Gen 32:31 , He halts.
